```
No wood. We can add a wooden stock at z .32 and a brown handguard. That would break up the black. Also make body slightly smaller (.16,.14,.44). Add a top rail and scope. Add a magazine. This will look more like a rifle. 
- Maybe rotate gun y -0.1 to show side. In screenshot, the gun is at a 3/4 view? It looks like a long block with a small block below; the barrel is not visible because it's behind the body from the camera angle? Actually the barrel at z -.31 (forward) should be visible extending left from the body toward center screen. But the big block extends to the left? The black block at x 610..830, y 470..590; the smaller block at 650..740, y 590..670. The barrel might be the left part. It's a block. Need better shape.

- The hint panel at bottom right overlaps the gun and actions? It sits at x 790..1000, y 510..560, above actions at y 580..625. Good. It is legible. The gun is behind it. Fine.

- The weapon bar bottom center has 7 buttons, good. Ammo HUD at x 230, y 590. It overlaps the leftmost weapon button? The ammo HUD is at bottom 76 => y 690? Wait screenshot ammo at x 230,y 590, weapon bar y 670..730. The ammo is above, okay. The location at bottom left y 700, overlaps weapon bar? It's left of weapon bar, okay.

- The top HUD: "TEST SUBJECTS 10", sound, 1P/3P, CLEAN. Good.
- The "GOD TOOLS" button top right. Good.
- The brand "MemeticBox" has a glitch: "MemeticBox" appears with a gray ghost/overlap (maybe font rendering or a duplicate? The screenshot shows "MemeticBox" with a gray shadow/offset behind). Could be the `.brand` text plus something? It looks like "MemeticBox" with a double exposure. Maybe because the font loaded twice? Or because the brand is 25px and the text has a shadow? There is no text-shadow. It could be the "MemeticBox" text plus the "PHYSICS SANDBOX" small text, but the ghost is above? The screenshot shows a gray ghost "MemeticBox" behind the white text, offset slightly. This might be a rendering artifact from the font loading or the `#start` overlay? No, start hidden. It could be the `brand` text duplicated by the browser? Maybe the `.brand` has `small` display block; no. It might be because the font `Barlow Condensed` is not loaded and fallback? No, ghost. Could be the "MemeticBox" in the start screen behind? Start display none. Hmm. Maybe the gray ghost is a **shadow of the brand** from the top overlay background? Unlikely. Could be a font anti-aliasing artifact due to screenshot compression? The text has a gray offset; perhaps the `.brand` is rendered twice due to the overlay and a duplicate? Check HTML: `<div class="brand">MemeticBox<small>PHYSICS SANDBOX</small></div>` only once. The ghost could be a CSS text-shadow inherited? `.brand` no. `text-shadow` on `#location` only. Maybe the font file has a weird outline? The "MemeticBox" in start screen looked normal. In mobile screenshot, the brand looked normal. In desktop final, the ghost is visible. Could be because the screenshot was taken during a font swap or the browser's subpixel rendering? It looks like a duplicate offset by 2px. Maybe the `brand` is overlapped by the start overlay's brand? Start display none, but the start overlay is hidden after play; maybe the start overlay still has a duplicate card? No.
